test case  :

```typescript
        let url = "test";   // test.png
        let callback = (err: Error | null, asset: Asset) => {

            if (err)
                console.warn(err);

                if (asset instanceof ImageAsset) {
                let tex = new Texture2D();
                tex.reset({
                    width: asset.width,
                    height: asset.height,
                });
                tex.uploadData(asset.data);   // fix this line , in native code asset.data is JSBNativeDataHolder
                let sp = new SpriteFrame();
                sp.texture = tex;
                // use this SpriteFrame
            }
        };

        resources.load(url, Asset, callback);
```

Run `yarn oclif manifest` before running NUTs so that each execution of `bin/run.js` can bypass manifest creation at runtime

[Successful test run](https://github.com/salesforcecli/plugin-limits/actions/runs/6696659435/job/18194935543)

